$$f\!\left(\sum_{n=1}^N a_n x_n\right) = \sum_{n=1}^N a_n\, f(x_n) = \sum_{n=1}^N a_n\, s_n = \sum_{n=1}^N |a_n| = \|a\|_1.$$

Since ‖f‖ = 1,

$$\left\|\sum_{n=1}^N a_n x_n\right\| \ge \|a\|_1.$$

